    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Primary intracranial sarcoma, <em>DICER1</em>-mutant",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "In addition to the defining <em>DICER1</em> mutation, these tumours often have accompanying <em>TP53</em> mutation resulting in aberrant accumulation of p53 protein that can be visualized by immunohistochemistry.",
    "source": "David A. Solomon",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/45/141/18089.jpg",
