    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Primary intracranial sarcoma, <em>DICER1</em>-mutant",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "These tumours demonstrate immunophenotypic evidence of myogenic differentiation, most frequently with expression of desmin as shown here.",
    "source": "David A. Solomon",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/45/141/18095.jpg",
